Holoself 0.10.1

Usage: holoself <command> [options]

Core commands:
  data-root | init | doctor | validate | migrate | export | upgrade
  web [--root <self-root>] [--project <linked-project>] [--port <n>] [--no-open]  Optional local Workbench
  link --target <dir>       Legacy live data-root junction
  unlink --target <dir>     Remove legacy managed junction

Linked ecosystem:
  skill status|install --scope user [--platform <id>] [--skill-home <dir>]
  lens list|show|validate|bind|unbind|bindings [id] [--root <self-root>]
  link add|status|remove|setup|activate|deactivate|repair|doctor --project <dir> [--self <dir>]
  link deactivate --project <dir> [--adapters all|<list>] [--dry-run|--yes]
  link skill migrate-global --project <dir> [--skill-home <dir>] [--dry-run|--yes]
  context [--project <dir>] [--lens <lens>] [--task <text>] [--session-start] [--json] [--snapshot --restricted-host --expires-hours <n>]
  analyze overlap|conflicts|stale|all --project <dir>
  propose --project <dir> [--claim <text> --source-file <path>]
  proposals list|audit --project <dir>
  proposals show|approve|reject|defer|supersede <id> --project <dir>
  index [status|rebuild] --project <dir> [--changed]
  search <query> --project <dir>
  instructions render|audit --project <dir> [--json]
  knowledge migrate-lenses [--output <plan>] | --apply <plan> --digest <sha256> --yes
  knowledge transform --replacements <json> [--plan-kind section-replacement|instruction-replacement] [--output <plan>]
  knowledge cleanup [--output <plan>] | --apply <plan> --digest <sha256> --yes

Data root: HOLOSELF_HOME or --data-dir <dir> (argument overrides environment).
Activation: --activate auto|all|<list> --platform <id> --instructions <file> --install-skill auto|project|global|none --no-activate.
Project filters: --project-include/--project-exclude and --project-assert-include/--project-assert-exclude <globs>.
Efficiency: context supports --budget small|standard|deep|unbounded, --manifest, repeatable --source, and --temporal current|historical|superseded|all.
Instruction consolidation: instructions render|audit --project <dir>.
Safety confirmations: --yes. Packet adapters: --adapter pi|claude|codex|generic|obsidian|restricted-host.
MCP: mcp [--project <linked-project>] | mcp configure|status --project <dir> [--platform codex|agy|claude].

Coaching: coaching start --root <self-root> --question <text>; coaching note|action|choose|review|material <session-id> --root <self-root> --expected-revision <n> [options]; coaching resume [session-id] --root <self-root>. Use coaching --help for details.
